{"type":"text","timestamp":1772836387549,"sessionID":"ses_33ab7ce6cffeKY4KUUDy0n9FCY","part":{"id":"prt_cc5485d5c0019iQc6cXas6DzXb","sessionID":"ses_33ab7ce6cffeKY4KUUDy0n9FCY","messageID":"msg_cc5484f0e00124q86YnXKrdvMr","type":"text","text":"{\n  \"questions\": [],\n  \"plan\": \"## Plan: Add Code Path to Board Configuration\\n\\n### Overview\\nAdd code path and context file support to each board's configuration so AI agents know where project code lives and have access to project-level context.\\n\\n### Implementation Steps\\n\\n1. **Update Config Schema**\\n   - Modify `~/.mad/config.json` schema to include a new `code_path` field\\n   - This field should point to the project root directory\\n   - Validate the path exists and is accessible\\n\\n2. **Create CONTEXT.md Support**\\n   - Add support for reading/writing `~/.mad/CONTEXT.md` file\\n   - This file will contain free-form project context\\n   - Provide CLI commands to edit/view the context file\\n\\n3. **Modify Agent Invocation**\\n   - Update agent startup to set working directory to project root (from `code_path`)\\n   - Prepend agent instructions with:\\n     - Code path information\\n     - Path to CONTEXT.md file\\n   - Ensure this happens on every agent invocation\\n\\n4. **Board Configuration Updates**\\n   - Each board should automatically derive or reference its project root\\n   - Board config should store/link to the `code_path`\\n   - When a board is invoked, read its associated `code_path` and `CONTEXT.md`\\n\\n5. **CLI Commands**\\n   - Add `mad config set-code-path <path>` to set the code path\\n   - Add `mad context edit` to edit CONTEXT.md\\n   - Add `mad context show` to display CONTEXT.md\\n\\n6. **Backward Compatibility**\\n   - If `code_path` is not set, derive from board location (current behavior)\\n   - If `CONTEXT.md` doesn't exist, provide empty context\\n\\n### Files to Modify\\n- Config handling code (likely in `src/config/` or similar)\\n- Agent invocation/launcher code\\n- CLI command handlers\\n- Board initialization code\\n\\n### Testing\\n- Verify code_path is correctly stored and retrieved\\n- Verify CONTEXT.md is created/read properly\\n- Verify agent working directory is set correctly\\n- Verify instructions include path info at top\"\n}","time":{"start":1772836387547,"end":1772836387547}}}
